@LocalRag.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5249

### OpenAPI document
GET {{LocalRag.Api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

###

### Health check
GET {{LocalRag.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Add a document (run before asking a question)
POST {{LocalRag.Api_HostAddress}}/api/documents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "source": "office-guide.txt",
  "content": "The Oslo office opens at 9:00 AM and closes at 5:00 PM, Monday through Friday. Visitors should check in at reception."
}

###

### Ask a question about the added document
POST {{LocalRag.Api_HostAddress}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What time does the Oslo office open?",
  "topK": 3
}

###

### Invalid topK (expect 400 Bad Request)
POST {{LocalRag.Api_HostAddress}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What time does the Oslo office open?",
  "topK": 11
}
